      "content": "Wait, I think I missed part of your explanation. You mentioned the steel provides the tensile strength, but how does that actually work mechanically within the concrete? Like, how do the two materials work together to handle the load if the concrete is doing most of the compressing? Also why did you mention goblins, I'm just trying to understand the physics of the material bond.",
